              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.9.10+1KI.9.11+1KI.9.12+1KI.9.13+1KI.9.14+1KI.9.15+1KI.9.16+1KI.9.17+1KI.9.18+1KI.9.19+1KI.9.20+1KI.9.21+1KI.9.22+1KI.9.23+1KI.9.24+1KI.9.25+1KI.9.26+1KI.9.27+1KI.9.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Asu 9.10–28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atĩ ndũa ila Ulamu wanengie Solomoni, Solomoni aitũngĩĩa, na ekalya ana ma Isilaeli kw’o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Solomoni athi Amathi‐sova, na amĩkĩlya vinya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na aaka ndũa ya Tatimoli weũnĩ, na ndũa syonthe sya kwia mĩio, ila wakie Amathi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O na aaka Mbethi‐oloni ĩla yĩ ĩũlũ, na Mbethi‐oloni ĩla yĩ ĩtheo, ndũa mbiie, syĩ na maũvai, na mbingĩlo, na ivingi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Mbaalathi, na ndũa syonthe sya kwia mĩio ila Solomoni waĩ nasyo, na ndũa syonthe kwondũ wa makasya make ma kaũ, na ndũa sya andũ make ala matũlaa mbalasi, na syonthe ila Solomoni wendie kwaka kwondũ wa kwĩtanĩthasya kwake Yelusaleme, na Levanoni, na nthĩ yonthe ya ũsumbĩko wake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ũndũ wa andũ onthe ala matialile ma Aititi, na Aamoli, na Avelisi, na Aivi, na Ayevusi, ala mataĩ ma Isilaeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma syana syoo ila syatialile ĩtina woo nthĩ ĩsu, ila ana ma Isilaeli mataaimina, imwe sya isu Solomoni amakwatĩthisye wĩa wa ũkombo kũvika ũmũnthĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ ma ana ma Isilaeli Solomoni ndaamatw’ĩkĩthya athũkũmi kwondũ wa wĩa wake; ĩndĩ asu maĩ andũ ma kaũ, na anene ma makavuteni make, na anene ma makasya make ma kaũ na ma andũ make ala matũlaa mbalasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na asu maĩ anene mbee ma kwa mũsumbĩ Solomoni, o maana elĩ na mĩongo ĩtano, ala masumbĩkaa andũ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
